{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "067cf73f0a2fba7895b5df30fb87a813f3dbc0105db58685f9600dd7cad25582", "ja": "神降ろしの夜", "zh": "降神之夜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d364756762ac52ffffa6616b18dea4108d8031dc4687577e7f4b5b19c08ef61f", "ja": "北の果てにあるその村では、人々が次々と\n命を落としていた。村を襲う『厄災』を\n止める為、村の少女・永混は『神降ろし』の\n儀式を行う。儀式は成功。友人の凛音亞は、\nこれでもう人が死ぬ事はなくなったと喜ぶ。", "zh": "在北方尽头的那个村子里，人们接连不断地\n丧失了性命。为了阻止袭击村子的“灾厄”，\n村里的少女永混举行了“降神”仪式。仪式成功了。\n朋友凛音亞欣喜地认为，这样一来就不会再有人死去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1000_se", "source_sha256": "649b1d5caaca96a0041b8f358e9a54ed1aa25e93f611eff41ad1fe93fb537cdf", "ja": "――ドンッ！！", "zh": "——咚！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1001_murabito", "source_sha256": "b93c4985162f9687ab6bcf352a9ec035af1e0563701a747076e1ad654cdd5e6a", "ja": "おお、この光！\nこの眩き輝きこそ、神の証……！", "zh": "哦哦，这道光！\n这耀眼的光辉正是神明的证明……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1002_murabito", "source_sha256": "e8d96703be292fd37e528ea939aa77dfceb0f9e687f1ef825a70e0b12a40760f", "ja": "『神降ろし』は成功した！\nようやくこの村にも、救いがもたらされる！", "zh": "“请神”成功了！\n这个村子终于也要得到救赎了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "6dce8d9994e55e049fd1f9a7f409f1ba6347b8524493b80644696cbbc4573a23", "ja": "（成功……？　本当に……？　\nこれで……『厄災』が、止まる……）", "zh": "（成功……？真的……？这样一来……『灾祸』就会停止了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "b4456da966aaeb02fc62fdfede66c4e3b58216796abc05bfb4fec38ecab4f5e3", "ja": "ん……。\n凛音亞（リンネア）……？", "zh": "嗯……凛音亚（琳涅亚）……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "9a41364cdf98637156dc29e5bc94871df954083df392c8bb3b14e2534ff1ea69", "ja": "永混（エマ）、気がついたのね！　よかった……。\n神降ろしの後、すぐに倒れてしまったから……。", "zh": "永混（艾玛），你醒过来了啊！太好了……降神仪式结束后，你马上就倒下了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "213531ad92ac431011c5348f13398a58c889f4861d2fd0e77fa840ad5a2cf91d", "ja": "夜羽那（ヨハンナ）お嬢様も、驚いていたわ。\n永混が、この村を救ったんだって……。", "zh": "夜羽那大小姐也很吃惊呢。\n说是永混拯救了这个村子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "a774008dc5accc1337556179a42c1abcfc4d541d70572669d5265e0fe8ac9f33", "ja": "神降ろし……。\nそうだ！　神降ろしは、儀式はどうなったの！？", "zh": "神灵降临……。\n对了！神灵降临的仪式，结果怎么样了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "d31b813a281a5aa7601da7b851c85988ca636b98cb691fcc4241fa857c86f66f", "ja": "安心して、成功したそうよ。\n永混のおかげで、この村は救われるはず……。", "zh": "放心吧，听说成功了哦。\n多亏了永混，这个村子应该能得救了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "b615c1382b6458d8ea6620cb955f51b49379774c1d7fe7fafba2eaab02304c7c", "ja": "成功、した……。", "zh": "成功了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "5627be6302a036f16fcd53f1289342328cfc31ae82da74172834e4ba7a84b54b", "ja": "（儀式の最中に見た、白い光と強い衝撃……\nあれが、神だった？　でも……）", "zh": "（仪式进行时看到的白光和强烈冲击……那就是神吗？可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1011_se", "source_sha256": "d3b84bab6ee2252918d5dbbd0ee7c070264f4dfe035a32d453e4f5d6ed17c56e", "ja": "ガタッ", "zh": "咔哒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "6c7f4d4d603066a60a6d0eedfcd942dc4e510491f8d14616f30f87dc55a59b57", "ja": "あら？　今の音は……\nふふっ、いつものお客さんね。", "zh": "咦？刚才那是什么声音……\n呵呵，是平时的客人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "1f636c75f3b8e2f8307f57152e5c66469458687b0a8596f5a424b93c282f3096", "ja": "ああ、逢路蘭（アウロラ）。\n入っていいよ、こっちにおいで。", "zh": "啊，是逢路兰（阿乌罗拉）。进来吧，到这边来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "07ddb98f755421955005dccf15732cee0b903f1739306bd7b641b738dec9770d", "ja": "永混が眠っている間、逢路蘭は食事も摂らなくて。\n私達の中じゃ、永混に一番懐いてたから……。", "zh": "永混睡着的时候，逢路兰连饭都不吃。\n因为在我们当中，她最亲近永混了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "81c230742280e12655146746535f6da167bc080264e79d5eb954f22eade9024f", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。ダメだよ、逢路蘭。\nご飯は、ちゃんと食べないと。", "zh": "原来是这样……不行哦，逢路蘭。要好好吃饭才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "d2d2d942d3dfb8e9cda7c6c3447b92f935ff6bb54cccb3f96576d919fba20ada", "ja": "逢路蘭、話せないものね。\n勝手に出歩いて、いなくなっちゃう事も多いし。", "zh": "逢路兰，你不会说话嘛。还经常擅自跑出去，突然就不见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "ceb6d5e1bd5be8a2df79d9ecd08e97f2e604bd577a75a78339261b6f6601cf9e", "ja": "逢路蘭、勝手にいなくなっちゃダメだよ？\nもう、私達しか残ってないんだから……。", "zh": "逢路兰，不可以擅自消失哦？毕竟，现在只剩下我们了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "e91c459f681c97b6c26bbae5d6d35e9d6f108b5cefd770d118be6da7d9413433", "ja": "永混……。", "zh": "永混……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1020_null", "source_sha256": "7960fad57bd1b77bcd691d04d5b1f95c45d4031dafa00b1a158f18d682b6f231", "ja": "ここは、北の果てにある寒村。\n外界との交流を避け、世界から忘れられた地。", "zh": "这里是位于北方尽头的寒冷村庄。\n这是一个避开与外界交流、被世界遗忘的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1021_null", "source_sha256": "4e09f98debd1990c150f76e2480a4036f4ba460259f15a86672b732d0be3a8a1", "ja": "閉ざされた村で、人々は自分達だけの戒律を守り。\n細々と、しかし穏やかに生活を営んでいた。", "zh": "在一座与世隔绝的村庄里，人们遵守着只属于自己的戒律，过着清贫却平静的生活。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1022_null", "source_sha256": "75b2ff97d0a438c5304a70e6087d0926c18cfbf266eff91751a0722f93d2936f", "ja": "あの恐ろしい、『厄災』が起こるまでは……。", "zh": "在那场可怕的“灾厄”发生之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "96d0566aeb29a8ebd9f899b6e5170e8af3b834bc56f0c1b1f510f66b5dd68d33", "ja": "神降ろしが成功した……\nなら、厄災も止まったんだね。", "zh": "神明降临成功了……\n那么，厄灾也止住了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "50ac6e0daead4369eab01e94f32e9f8982bf02f228fd89c3b414f2f7887394b3", "ja": "ええ。山が崩れたり、川が溢れたり、\n原因不明の病に倒れたり……そんな事はなくなるの。", "zh": "是的。山体崩塌、河水泛滥，或是因不明原因患病倒下……这样的事都不会再发生了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "b907722f46152a9cc46cd10594550db7e7ef0cff8b5d1f80ba6dc58aa2e59969", "ja": "これで……これでやっと、訳のわからない理由で\n人が死ぬ事がなくなったんだわ……。", "zh": "这样……这样一来，终于不会再有人因为莫名其妙的原因死去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "f7d709b440761c2ba83d82017eb80beb31fe0f1649dff9d9f6905f8e98ed257c", "ja": "そういえば、あの学者先生は？\n都会から来てるっていう……。", "zh": "说起来，那位学者先生呢？\n听说是从大城市来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_01_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "76597a89f360c1e9b5f30fc12e2ba172e933edddf36059184b73a88df880641e", "ja": "深淵海（ヘルミ）先生なら、\n夜羽那お嬢様のお屋敷じゃないかしら。", "zh": "如果是深渊海（赫尔米）老师，应该在夜羽那小姐的宅邸吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
